rce\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1.35 kg (2.7 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1.35 kg (2.7 lb)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 65 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  65  gp</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Kuotoa_Lightning_Spear</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Kuotoa_Lightning_Spear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Kuotoa_Lightning_Spear\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">5dc55fa5-40df-4e67-ab78-d9320176e614</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5dc55fa5-40df-4e67-ab78-d9320176e614\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5dc55fa5-40df-4e67-ab78-d9320176e614\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Kuotoa_Lightning_Spear</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Kuotoa_Lightning_Spear+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Kuotoa_Lightning_Spear+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Sting\" title=\"Shocking Sting\">Shocking Sting</a></dt><dd>On a hit, possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\">Shock</a><sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Sting#Bugs\" title=\"Shocking Sting\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> your target.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Throwing:_Lightning_Damage\" title=\"Throwing: Lightning Damage\">Throwing: Lightning Damage</a></dt><dd>When launched at a target, deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage.</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rush_Attack\" title=\"Rush Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rush Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rush_Attack\" title=\"Rush Attack\">Rush Attack</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Charge forward and attack the first enemy in your way, possibly pushing them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Off Balance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\">Off Balance</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Shocking_Grasp\"> Condition: Shocking Grasp </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocking Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\">Shocking Grasp</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Cannot take <a href=\"/wiki/Reactions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reactions\">Reactions</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Town\" title=\"Reithwin Town\">Reithwin Town</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-148&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;115</span>: Carried by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa Chief\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png/25px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png/38px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png/50px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa Chief\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png/25px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa Chief\">Cursed Kuo-Toa Chief</a> in the Cursed Kuo-toa ambush North East of the <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Mausoleum\" title=\"Grand Mausoleum\">Grand Mausoleum</a> entrance</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The description of Throwing: Lightning Damage is somewhat misleading, as the spear does the same <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage when thrown as when used in a melee attack. However most thrown weapons do not apply their extra damage when thrown, which is what the passive enables.</li>\n<li>When the Lightning Jabber is <a href=\"/wiki/Dip\" title=\"Dip\">dipped</a> into a dippable <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a>, it receives the coating but it also removes the dippable surface.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Throwing: Lightning Damage:</i></p>\n<ul><li>This <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> bonus damage is dealt when thrown even on miss.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite being labelled as a Spear, the <code>Root Template</code> is erroneously tagged as a Javelin and as such does not work with the <a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Polearm Master\">Polearm Master</a> feat.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Shocking Sting:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip for Shocking Sting says it has chance to apply <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocked\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\">Shocked</a>, but the condition actually applied is the similar but less potent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocking Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\">Shocking Grasp</a>.</li>\n<li>There is a saving throw for the Shocking Grasp condition, but the combat log does not show it.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png/450px-Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png/675px-Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png/450px-Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Lightning_Jabber_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194909\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.150 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.163 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5912/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89192/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21799/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 970/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.037/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1720199/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  134.040      1 Template:WeaponPage\n100.00%  134.040      1 -total\n 32.04%   42.942     71 Template:Trim\n 28.75%   38.532     18 Template:Icon_text\n 21.04%   28.208     11 Template:Icon_link\n 16.15%   21.651      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.92%   21.336      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.54%   15.468     19 Template:Ifempty\n 10